# TabsStepper

`src/components/TabsStepper.jsx` + `TabsStepper.scss`. Extracted from "Option 3: Tabs as Stepper" on `/progress-preview`, which now uses it.

Props: `steps` ([{key,label}]), `currentIndex`, `ariaLabel`, `renderPanel(step, index)`.

Built on Carbon `Tabs`; only the current tab is enabled, completed steps show a success-colored checkmark marker. Scrolls horizontally on mobile with many steps. Uses global tokens only.
